[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2539303395","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100269#issuecomment-2539303395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100269","id":2539303395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XWrHj","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-12T15:34:59Z","updated_at":"2024-12-12T15:34:59Z","body":"> I think this may have trouble getting merged though since not all of the reserve calls are trivial. There's quite a lot of text to sift through to find whether each of the reserves are correct. Especially, some may be better served with a different approach entirely (in-place allocation, known-length map, etc.).\r\n\r\nAll these cases are trival enough. I restrict myself to behave somehow like a smarter linter and avoid any possible regressions. I've filtered these changes 2 times to ensure every call to the `reserve` can at least reduce one realloc, so they should all benifit performance (although not much if on cold path).\r\n\r\n> It may be better to see if any of the spots are in particular need of speed up, adding a reserve there, making a small PR, and getting it approved by someone with knowledge of that particular spot of code.\r\n\r\nActually I suspect these are ethier too corner case or just not hot enough to make people aware of them. Should probably be treated as a refactor instead of optimization.\r\n\r\nThat said, no one knows if this won't benefit performance a bit (like editor startup time).\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2539303395/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2542481310","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100269#issuecomment-2542481310","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100269","id":2542481310,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Xiy-e","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-13T22:27:03Z","updated_at":"