erve()` will actually reserve more than necessary. `push_back()` has the same behavior though, just pointing that it might still be improved.\r\n\r\nThat's a good point, if the maximum size is guaranteed, we can use a TightLocalVector instead\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2542608197/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2542810973","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100269#issuecomment-2542810973","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100269","id":2542810973,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XkDdd","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-14T04:33:19Z","updated_at":"2024-12-14T04:33:19Z","body":"> `tight` is false by default, which means each `reserve()` will actually reserve more than necessary. `push_back()` has the same behavior though, 